        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient and daughter report she is slightly more forgetful about dates and misplacing items. Remains independent in basic ADLs and needs prompting for some IADLs, especially bills; medications are in a Webster pack. Patient worries that increased worrying means dementia is progressing rapidly."
      }
    },
